OL,3,GNEWSABanned teacher punched wall near
OL,4,Apupils' heads
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher has been banned from the
OL,7,Fprofession indefinitely after punching
OL,8,Fthe wall near two pupils' heads and
OL,9,Fthreatening them with violence.
OL,11,FDavid Hicks worked as a physics teacher
OL,12,Fat the private Downside School in
OL,13,FStratton-on-the-Fosse, on the edge of
OL,14,Fthe Mendip Hills in Somerset.
OL,16,FHicks, who did not attend the
OL,17,Fproceedings, admitted making threats to
OL,18,Fthe effect of "I would really like to
OL,19,Fpunch your face in" and "once I start
OL,20,Fhitting you I won't stop" during a
OL,21,Fscience lesson in February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
