OL,5,
OL,6,FA Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,7,Fprofessional conduct panel ruled Hick's
OL,8,Fconduct fell significantly short of the
OL,9,Fstandards expected, and that
OL,10,Fprohibition was both "proportionate and
OL,11,Fappropriate".
